Bug Bounty Part 4: Mapping

# For any tool that requires a "bug bounty" user agent, I configure it accordingly before testing.
- Before starting any work, I perform a full system scan using ESET, Bitdefender, Malwarebytes, and Windows Defender.
- Once the work is complete, I clear my terminal history and browser history.
- For the "Mapping" phase, I utilize Claude AI, however, I do not share any specific company details with it-I simply use generic placeholders like "example.com"
- I use my real IP address on the computer where I access Claude AI, while I use a VPN on the computer dedicated to bug bounty works.
- I never share company data anywhere, and I do not  disclose wich companies I am working with to anyone.

